pt src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2n5qeheznvl4u.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1_miqk4gqcfj7.js\" async=\"\"></script><title>Albarza — The best AI video generator for creators</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Create cinematic, high quality videos from text prompts or image references using industry leading AI models.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/brand/logo.svg\"/><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 z-40\"><div class=\"flex h-[76px] items-center justify-between px-5 md:px-10\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-12\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\" href=\"/en\"><img src=\"/brand/logo.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"26\" height=\"32\"/><span class=\"text-lg font-bold tracking-wide\">Albarza</span></a><nav class=\"hidden items-center gap-8 text-sm font-medium lg:flex\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 hover:text-gold-hi\" href=\"/en/image-generator\">AI Image<svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 hover:text-gold-hi\" href=\"/en/video-generator/veo-3-1\">AI Video<svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 hover:text-gold-hi\" href=\"/en/signup\">AI Editor</a><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 hover:text-gold-hi\" href=\"/en/signup\">Explore</a><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 hover:text-gold-hi\" href=\"/en/signup\">Templates</a></nav></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-5 text-sm font-medium\"><a hrefLang=\"ar\" class=\"text-white/80 hover:text-white\" href=\"/ar\">العربية</a><a class=\"hidden hover:text-gold-hi sm:block\" href=\"/en/pricing\">Pricing</a><a class=\"hover:text-gold-hi\" href=\"/en/login\">Sign in</a><a class=\"btn btn-gold !px-6\" href=\"/en/signup\">Sign Up</a></div></div></header><main><section class=\"relative flex min-h-[100svh] items-end justify-center overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"/media/hero.svg\" alt=\"\" fetchPriority=\"high\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-black/50 via-transparent to-black/70\"></div><nav aria-label=\"breadcrumb\" class=\"absolute start-10 top-[112px] z-10 hidden text-sm text-white/80 md:block\"><a href=\"/en\">Home</a> <span class=\"px-1\">/</span> <span class=\"text-white\">AI Image</span></nav><div class=\"relative z-10 mx-auto flex w-full max-w-[1000px] flex-col items-center px-5 pb-28 text-center\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight md:text-5xl\">The best AI image generator</h1><p class=\"mt-5 text-sm leading-7 text-white/90 md:text-base md:leading-8\">Turn text prompts into high-quality images with the latest image models, then animate them into video in one click.</p><form class=\"glass mt-8 flex w-full max-w-2xl items-center gap-3 rounded-full py-2 ps-7 pe-2\" action=\"/en/signup\"><input maxLength=\"1000\" placeholder=\"Describe the image you want\" class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 bg-transparent py-2.5 text-sm outline-none placeholder:text-white/60\" name=\"prompt\"/><button class=\"btn btn-white\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3l2 6 6 2-6 2-2 6-2-6-6-2 6-2zM19 3v4M17 5h4\"></path></svg>Generate</button></form></div></section><section class=\"section\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight md:text-[40px]\">How to generate AI videos</h2><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-3xl text-muted\">Albarza&#x27;s tools are intuitive by design, making it easy to create standout animated clips and cinematic visuals. Whether you start from a prompt, your photos, or just something sketched out, these steps show how to turn it into finished video.</p><div class=\"mt-6\"><a class=\"btn btn-gold\" href=\"/en/signup\">Start Creating</a></div><div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3\"><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold\"><span class=\"text-gold\">1<!-- -->.</span> <!-- -->Go to the video tool</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">Open the Albarza video tool, then choose to start from a prompt, a photo, or an idea, with optional reference images.</p><img src=\"/media/gallery-2.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"mt-5 h-60 w-full rounded-2xl border border-line object-cover\"/></div><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold\"><span class=\"text-gold\">2<!-- -->.</span> <!-- -->Choose your video model</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">Pick an AI video model, then set your aspect ratio, resolution and duration, with optional start and end frames.</p><img src=\"/media/gallery-3.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"mt-5 h-60 w-full rounded-2xl border border-line object-cover\"/></div><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold\"><span class=\"text-gold\">3<!-- -->.</span> <!-- -->Generate and refine your results</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">Get your new video in seconds, download it or tweak the prompt a little and iterate until it&#x27;s right.</p><img src=\"/media/gallery-4.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"mt-5 h-60 w-full rounded-2xl border border-line object-cover\"/></div></div></section><section class=\"section pt-0\"><div class=\"grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2\"><article class=\"card flex overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"/media/gallery-6.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"hidden h-auto w-40 shrink-0 object-cover sm:block\"/><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">One-Click Video Recreation</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">Recreate trending clips or reimagine iconic scenes — the AI captures style, structure, and intent, so you skip hours of manual editing.</p></div></article><article class=\"card flex overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"/media/gallery-7.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"hidden h-auto w-40 shrink-0 object-cover sm:block\"/><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Frame-Level Precision</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">Guide every shot with reference images and camera controls — composition, motion, and detail stay exactly on brief.</p></div></article><article class=\"card flex overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"/media/gallery-8.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"hidden h-auto w-40 shrink-0 object-cover sm:block\"/><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Multi-Camera Storytelling</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">Cut between angles and scenes while your characters, products, and style stay consistent shot to shot.</p></div></article><article class=\"card flex overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"/media/gallery-9.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"hidden h-auto w-40 shrink-0 object-cover sm:block\"/><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">High-Impact Motion Scenes</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">Create fast, dynamic action — chases, crowds, and sweeping camera moves — straight from a single prompt.</p></div></article></div></section><section class=\"py-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-5 text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight md:text-[40px]\">Create anything you want with Albarza&#x27;s toolkit</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-muted\">One workspace for video, image and voice generation — so you can take on your biggest creative projects without switching tools.</p></div><div class=\"noscroll mt-10 flex snap-x gap-5 overflow-x-auto px-5\"><article class=\"relative h-[440px] w-[78vw] max-w-[640px] shrink-0 snap-center overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-line\"><img src=\"/media/gallery-1.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover\"/><div class=\"glass absolute inset-x-4 bottom-4 flex items-center justify-between rounded-2xl p-4\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Video</h3><a class=\"btn btn-white !py-1.5\" href=\"/en/signup\">Try the tool</a></div></article><article class=\"relative h-[440px] w-[78vw] max-w-[640px] shrink-0 snap-center overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-line\"><img src=\"/media/gallery-2.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover\"/><div class=\"glass absolute inset-x-4 bottom-4 flex items-center justify-between rounded-2xl p-4\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Image</h3><a class=\"btn btn-white !py-1.5\" href=\"/en/signup\">Try the tool</a></div></article><article class=\"relative h-[440px] w-[78vw] max-w-[640px] shrink-0 snap-center overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-line\"><img src=\"/media/gallery-3.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover\"/><div class=\"glass absolute inset-x-4 bottom-4 flex items-center justify-between rounded-2xl p-4\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Lip-sync</h3><a class=\"btn btn-white !py-1.5\" href=\"/en/signup\">Try the tool</a></div></article><article class=\"relative h-[440px] w-[78vw] max-w-[640px] shrink-0 snap-center overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-line\"><img src=\"/media/gallery-4.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover\"/><div class=\"glass absolute inset-x-4 bottom-4 flex items-center justify-between rounded-2xl p-4\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Upscale</h3><a class=\"btn btn-white !py-1.5\" href=\"/en/signup\">Try the tool</a></div></article><article class=\"relative h-[440px] w-[78vw] max-w-[640px] shrink-0 snap-center overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-line\"><img src=\"/media/gallery-5.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover\"/><div class=\"glass absolute inset-x-4 bottom-4 flex items-center justify-between rounded-2xl p-4\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Text to Voice</h3><a class=\"btn btn-white !py-1.5\" href=\"/en/signup\">Try the tool</a></div></article><article class=\"relative h-[440px] w-[78vw] max-w-[640px] shrink-0 snap-center overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-line\"><img src=\"/media/gallery-6.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover\"/><div class=\"glass absolute inset-x-4 bottom-4 flex items-center justify-between rounded-2xl p-4\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Voice Changer</h3><a class=\"btn btn-white !py-1.5\" href=\"/en/signup\">Try the tool</a></div></article></div></section><section class=\"section max-w-3xl\"><div class=\"text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight md:text-[40px]\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2></div><div class=\"mt-10 divide-y divide-line border-y border-line\"><details class=\"group py-5\" open=\"\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-medium\">What is Albarza&#x27;s AI video generator?<span class=\"text-gold transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">Albarza&#x27;s AI Video Generator turns text prompts and images into short video clips and lets you compare multiple video models in one workspace. Start with a clear brief, generate a first result, and refine the detail that needs improvement.</p></details><details class=\"group py-5\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-medium\">How do I generate a video from an image?<span class=\"text-gold transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">Upload a photo or choose an image from your previous sessions, add a text prompt, adjust your settings, and click Generate. You can control the start and end frames of each clip. A short, specific prompt is usually enough for a clean first result.</p></details><details class=\"group py-5\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-medium\">Can I use AI-generated videos in commercial projects?<span class=\"text-gold transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">Yes, as long as they comply with Albarza&#x27;s Terms of Use and UAE law. Use cases include client work, social media content, ads, and marketing campaigns.</p></details><details class=\"group py-5\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-medium\">What rights do I have over AI-generated videos?<span class=\"text-gold transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">You keep full rights to the videos you create. You are free to use, modify, distribute, and monetize them, subject to the License and Terms of Use. Albarza does not claim ownership of your generated content.</p></details><details class=\"group py-5\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-medium\">Are my video outputs used to train AI models?<span class=\"text-gold transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">No. Albarza does not use your prompts, uploads, or generated videos to train AI models. All outputs are private and protected under strict security standards and the UAE PDPL.</p></details><details class=\"group py-5\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-medium\">What AI video models are available?<span class=\"text-gold transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">The model picker includes Seedance, Veo, Kling, Wan, Sora, and others. Compare duration, resolution, audio support, and credit cost, then test the same brief in two models.</p></details><details class=\"group py-5\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-medium\">How do I write a prompt for an AI video?<span class=\"text-gold transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">Describe the subject, action, setting, shot size, camera movement, and lighting. Example: “A red bicycle rolls along a coastal road at sunrise; steady side-tracking shot, soft golden light.” Review the clip and revise the detail that missed your intent.</p></details><details class=\"group py-5\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-medium\">Can I turn a photo into an AI video?<span class=\"text-gold transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">Yes. Add the photo as Start Image in the Video workspace, describe the subject&#x27;s movement and camera direction, and choose a model. Review the preview and settings before generating.</p></details><details class=\"group py-5\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-medium\">How are AI video generations charged?<span class=\"text-gold transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">Albarza shows the credit cost before you generate. Select the model and settings, review the displayed amount, and confirm. Prices are in AED, inclusive of VAT.</p></details><details class=\"group py-5\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-medium\">How do I choose between AI video models?<span class=\"text-gold transition group-open:rotate-45\">+</span></summary><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted\">Use the same short prompt, aspect ratio, and source image in two models. Compare motion quality, subject consistency, audio support, duration, resolution, and cost. Choose the output that fits the final channel.</p></details></div></section><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden py-28 text-center\"><img src=\"/media/hero.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover opacity-60\"/><div class=\"relative\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight md:text-[40px]\">Design with Albarza</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-white/80\">Create with momentum. Bring your vision to life.</p><div class=\"mt-8\"><a class=\"btn btn-gold\" href=\"/en/signup\">Sign Up</a></div></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"border-t border-line\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-5 py-16\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\" href=\"/en\"><img src=\"/brand/logo.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"26\" height=\"32\"/><span class=\"text-lg font-bold tracking-wide\">Albarza</span></a><div class=\"mt-12 grid grid-cols-2 gap-10 md:grid-cols-4\"><div><h4 class=\"mb-4 text-sm font-semibold\">Models</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2.5 text-sm text-muted\"><li><a class=\"hover:text-white\" href=\"/en/video-generator/sora-2\">Sora 2</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white\" href=\"/en/video-generator/sora-2-pro\">Sora 2 Pro</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white\" href=\"/en/video-generator/veo-3-1\">Veo 3.1</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white\" href=\"/en/video-generator/veo-3-1-fast\">Veo 3.1 Fast</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white\" href=\"/en/video-generator/seedance-2-5\">Seedance 2.5</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white\" href=\"/en/video-generator/s